<heading>accounts edit - Update an account.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  edit NAME [--password SECRET] [--enabled true|false]
           [--name NAME] [--mail MAIL] [--language LANG]
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Updates an existing account. At least one option must be provided.
Use --enabled to activate or deactivate an account, --password to change
credentials, and --name/--mail/--language to update profile information.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
edit stefan --name "Stefan Bergmann"
  Update the profile name of account stefan.
edit bob --enabled false
  Deactivate the bob account.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
add, list, delete, groups, grants
</paragraph>
